    "datalink_cutout": "a cutout gets the pixels around a target without downloading the whole image. pyvo (`DatalinkRecord.processed`) and astroquery (`Cadc.get_image_list`) each take one CADC image from its ObsCore table, follow the image's DataLink to its `#cutout` SODA service and ask for a circle of radius 0.1° around the image centre.",
